            /** @description What must change before the action can be confirmed -- for example WORKSPACE_RESIDUE_BLOCKED (unexpected files in the workspace are not attributed yet) or NO_ELIGIBLE_WORKER (no other worker may take the work) -- with the sentence to show; null when nothing does. */
